  "html": "<p>List of Two Handed Fighter Weapons.<br/><br/>\n</p><p><small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by. A 2 column sort is also possible, by first sorting one column then the second. </small>\n</p>\n<table border=\"2\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Handedness\n</th><th>Type\n</th><th>Speed\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Comment\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Axiotic.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Axiotic.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Axiotic.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Axiotic.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td>Axotic\n</td><td>Two-Handed\n</td><td>Slashing\n</td><td>Slothful\n</td><td>Unique Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Barbarian_Axe.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Barbarian_Axe.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Barbarian_Axe.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Barbarian_Axe.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td>Barbarian Axe\n</td><td>Two-Handed\n</td><td>Slashing\n</td><td>Slothful\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Serrated_Axe.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Serrated_Axe.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Serrated_Axe.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Serrated_Axe.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td>Serrated Axe\n</td><td>Two-Handed\n</td><td>Slashing\n</td><td>Normal\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Battalion_Splitter.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Battalion_Splitter.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Battalion_Splitter.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Battalion_Splitter.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td>Battalion Splitter\n</td><td>Two-H